am - Srikrishna Vatharam","url":"https://www.jiosaavn.com/song/padhyam-srikrishna-vatharam/NRJdBzB4RgQ","singers":"Ghantasala, Madhavapeddi Satyam, N. T. Rama Rao, Sathyanarayana, Ramakrishna"},{"title":"Adigo Aladigo","url":"https://www.jiosaavn.com/song/adigo-aladigo/FAEoYBVXX0A","singers":"Ghantasala"}],"jiosaavn_album_url":"https://www.jiosaavn.com/album/sri-krishnavatharam/mQc3Ap5CfRQ_"}